        "short_descp": "<p style="line-height: 1;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="line-height: 1;">Model: Logitech M90</p> <p style="line-height: 1;">Connectivity: Wired (USB)</p> <p style="line-height: 1;">Number of buttons: 3</p> <p style="line-height: 1;">Sensor Resolution: 1000</p> <p style="line-height: 1;">Cable Length: 150 cm</p>",
        "long_descp": "<h4 data-start="239" data-end="270">🖱️ <span style="color: #e03e2d;"><a style="color: #e03e2d;" title="Logitech M90 USB Mouse" href="../../../logitech-m90-usb-mouse" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Logitech M90 USB Mouse</a></span></h4> <p>Simple. Reliable. Ready to Perform &ndash; Now at <strong><span style="color: #e03e2d;"><a style="color: #e03e2d;" title="TBZ Engineering bd" href="../../../" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TBZ Engineering</a></span></strong></p> <p data-start="339" data-end="709">Meet the <strong><span style="color: #e03e2d;"><a style="color: #e03e2d;" title="Logitech M90 USB Mouse" href="../../../logitech-m90-usb-mouse" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Logitech M90 USB Mouse</a></span></strong> &mdash; the ultimate everyday companion for your desktop or laptop. Built with simplicity, accuracy, and comfort in mind, this mouse is a perfect fit for anyone looking for dependable performance at an unbeatable price. Whether for work, study, or casual browsing, the M90 is your go-to solution &mdash; now available from <strong><span style="color: #e03e2d;"><a style="color: #e03e2d;" title="TBZ Engineering bd." href="../../../" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TBZ Engineering.</a></span></strong></p> <hr data-start="711" data-end="714" /> <h4 data-start="716" data-end="736">🔍 Key Features:</h4> <p>✅ Precision Optical Tracking<br data-start="770" data-end="773" />Equipped with a 1000 DPI high-definition optical sensor for smooth, accurate cursor control across almost any surface.</p> <p>✅ Ergonomic Comfort<br data-start="916" data-end="919" />Its ambidextrous design fits comfortably in either hand, making it suitable for left or right-handed users during long working hours.</p> <p data-start="1054" data-end="1185">✅ Plug &amp; Play Simplicity<br data-start="1082" data-end="1085" />Just connect it to your computer's USB port and you're good to go &mdash; no software or battery required.</p> <p data-start="1187" data-end="1349">✅ Three-Button Control<br data-start="1213" data-end="1216" />Left-click, right-click, and scroll with ease. The integrated scroll wheel ensures smooth navigation through documents and web pages.</p> <p data-start="1351" data-end="1525">✅ Built for Durability Crafted with quality materials, the M90 is designed to last, even with heavy daily usage &mdash; making it a smart choice for both home and office use.</p> <h4 data-start="2270" data-end="2308">🛍️ Why Shop at TBZ Engineering?</h4> <ul data-start="2310" data-end="2433"> <li data-start="2310" data-end="2337"> <h4 data-start="2312" data-end="2337">✅ 100% Genuine Products</h4> </li> <li data-start="2338" data-end="2368"> <p data-start="2340" data-end="2368">⚡ Fast Nationwide Delivery</p> </li> <li data-start="2369" data-end="2400"> <p data-start="2371" data-end="2400">🛡️ 3-Year Warranty Support</p> </li> <li data-start="2401" data-end="2433"> <p data-start="2403" data-end="2433">💬 Friendly Customer Service</p> </li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p>",
