        "short_descp": "<p style="line-height: 1;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="line-height: 1;">Model: MF2219-B</p> <p style="line-height: 1;">Resolution: Full HD (1920 &times; 1080)</p> <p style="line-height: 1;">Panel Type: IPS</p> <p style="line-height: 1;">Refresh Rate: 100Hz</p> <p style="line-height: 1;">Response Time: 5ms</p> <p style="line-height: 1;">Ports: 1&times; HDMI, 1&times; VGA</p> <p style="line-height: 1;">Eye Comfort Features: Low Blue Light, Flicker-Free, Eye Protection</p> <p style="line-height: 1;">Mounting Support: VESA (75&times;75mm)</p>",
        "long_descp": "<h3><strong><span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';">📝</span> Product Overview:</strong></h3> <p data-start="1880" data-end="2162">The <span style="color: #e03e2d;"><a style="color: #e03e2d;" title="Aiwa MF2219-B 22&quot; Full HD Monitor" href="../../../aiwa-mf2219-b-22-inch-fhd-ips-100hz-monitor" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong data-start="1884" data-end="1921">Aiwa MF2219-B 22" Full HD Monitor</strong></a></span> blends visual clarity with user comfort, making it a smart option for daily computing, online work, multimedia, or casual gaming. With a crisp <strong data-start="2065" data-end="2089">1920&times;1080 resolution</strong> and vibrant <strong data-start="2102" data-end="2115">IPS panel</strong>, you'll enjoy stunning visuals from any angle.</p> <p data-start="2164" data-end="2326">Its <strong data-start="2168" data-end="2190">100Hz refresh rate</strong> ensures buttery-smooth motion, while <strong data-start="2228" data-end="2274">Low Blue Light and Flicker-Free technology</strong> keep your eyes relaxed, even during extended usage.</p> <p data-start="2328" data-end="2557">Whether you're connecting to a desktop or laptop, the <strong data-start="2382" data-end="2404">HDMI and VGA ports</strong> provide hassle-free compatibility. While it does not have built-in speakers or audio ports, external audio devices can be connected to your PC directly.</p> <p data-start="2559" data-end="2700">With <strong data-start="2564" data-end="2586">tilt adjustability</strong>, <strong data-start="2588" data-end="2610">VESA mount support</strong>, and a modern black finish, this monitor offers flexibility and style for any desk setup.</p> <div class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;" align="center"><hr align="center" size="2" width="100%" data-start="2702" data-end="2705" /></div> <h3 data-start="2707" data-end="2744"><span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';">💰</span> <strong data-start="2713" data-end="2744">Latest Price in Bangladesh:</strong></h3> <p data-start="2745" data-end="2918"><strong data-start="2745" data-end="2760">Only </strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Nirmala UI',sans-serif;">৳8</span>,
        500</strong><br data-start="2760" data-end="2763" /><span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';">📍</span> Available at <strong data-start="2779" data-end="2806"><span style="color: #e03e2d;"><a style="color: #e03e2d;" title="TBZ Engineering Bd" href="../../../" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TBZ Engineering</a> </span>.</strong><br data-start="2806" data-end="2809" /><span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';">📦</span> Order online or visit your nearest TBZ showroom to get the best deal.<br data-start="2881" data-end="2884" /><span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';">🛠</span> Comes with <strong data-start="2898" data-end="2918">3 Years Warranty</strong></p> <div class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;" align="center"><hr align="center" size="2" width="100%" data-start="2920" data-end="2923" /></div> <h3 data-start="2925" data-end="2968"><span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';">❓</span> <strong data-start="2931" data-end="2968"><span style="font-family: 'Calibri Light',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; font-weight: normal;">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ):</span></strong></h3> <p data-start="2970" data-end="3086"><strong data-start="2970" data-end="3017">Q: Does the monitor have built-in speakers?</strong><br data-start="3017" data-end="3020" /><strong data-start="3020" data-end="3026">A:</strong> No, there are no built-in speakers or audio output options.</p> <p data-start="3088" data-end="3185"><strong data-start="3088" data-end="3118">Q: Can it be wall-mounted?</strong><br data-start="3118" data-end="3121" /><strong data-start="3121" data-end="3127">A:</strong> Yes, the monitor supports <strong data-start="3154" data-end="3184">75&times;75mm VESA wall mounting</strong>.</p>","product_thumbnail": "17481599821032600512.jpeg",
